From: sneezeparty <38020091+sneezeparty@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 06:04:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] applets/pager: Show each desktop's wallpaper, and make
 outlines over thumbnails optional

The pager draws the wallpaper of each virtual desktop per screen itself, read from the containments' wallpaper configuration, and asks for desktop streams without the background when it does. The settings page offers window outlines or live thumbnails as the tile style.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
